{"strongs": "H1347", "word": "גָּאוֺן", "translit": "ga.on", "root": "בתת", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "exaltation", "definition": "גָּאוֺן noun masculine Hos 5:5 exaltation — Job 40:10 + 5 t.; construct גְּאוֺן Lev 26:19 + 31 t.; suffix גְּאוֺנְךָ etc. Exod 15:7 + 9 t.; plural suffix גְּאוֺנָ֑יִךְ Ezek 16:56 — 1. exaltation, majesty, excellence , \\ \\ a. of nations, their wealth, power, magnificence of buildings, e.g. Egypt Ezek 32:12 , Chaldeans Isa 13:11 ; Isa 13:19 ; Isa 14:11 , Philistines Zech 9:6 , Assyria Zech 10:11 , Jacob Ps 47:5 ; Amos 6:8 ; Amos 8:7 ; Nah 2:3 , Israel Hos 5:5 ; Hos 7:10 (probably appellation of ׳ י ), Nah 2:3 , Judah Jer 13:9 , Jerusalem v Jer 13:9 ; Ezek 16:56 גְּאוֺן עֻזָּהּ pride of her strength Ezek 30:6 ; Ezek 30:18 ; Ezek 33:28 גאון עזים Ezek 7:24 (but ᵐ5 Ew Hi Co read עזם ); גאון עזכם Lev 26:19 ; Ezek 24:21 the fruit of land of Judah will become לגאון ולתפארת majestic and beautiful Isa 4:2 גאון כל צבי the majesty of all the splendour (of Tyre) Isa 23:9 Zion is to become גאון עולם an everlasting excellency Isa 60:15 . \\ \\ b. of God Exod 15:7 ; Isa 24:14 ; Mic 5:3 הֲדַר גְּאֹנוֺ Isa 2:10 ; Isa 2:19 ; Isa 2:21 יַרְעֵם בְּקוֺל גְּאוֺנוֺ Job 37:4 עֲדֵה נָא גָּאוֺן וָגֹבַהּ Job 40:10 . \\ \\ c. גאון הירדן majesty of Jordan , referring to the green and shady banks, clothed with willows, tamarisks, and cane, in which the lions made their covert Jer 49:19 ; Jer 50:44 ; Zech 11:3 , and therefore dangerous Jer 12:5 ( Ew thinks of the swelling of its agitated waters); גְּאוֺן גַּלֶּיךָ majesty of thy waves Job 38:11 . 2. pride (bad sense) Job 35:12 ; Ps 59:13 ; Prov 8:13 ; Prov 16:18 ; Ezek 7:20 ; Ezek 16:49 ; Zeph 2:10 of Moab Isa 16:6 (twice in verse) = Jer 48:29 (twice in verse).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1400')\">BDB1400</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1347')\">H1347</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1399')\">BDB1399</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1401')\">BDB1401</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>גָּאוֺן</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Hos 5:5\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(28,5,5)\">Hos 5:5</ref></sup> <highlightword>exaltation</highlightword> — <ref ref=\"Job 40:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,10)\">Job 40:10</ref> + 5 t.; construct <bdbheb>גְּאוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 26:19\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,19)\">Lev 26:19</ref> + 31 t.; suffix <bdbheb>גְּאוֺנְךָ</bdbheb> etc. <ref ref=\"Exod 15:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,7)\">Exod 15:7</ref> + 9 t.; plural suffix <bdbheb>גְּאוֺנָ֑יִךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:56\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"56\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"56\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,56)\">Ezek 16:56</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>exaltation, majesty, excellence</highlight>, <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of nations, their wealth, power, magnificence of buildings, e.g. Egypt <ref ref=\"Ezek 32:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,12)\">Ezek 32:12</ref>, Chaldeans <ref ref=\"Isa 13:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,13,11)\">Isa 13:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 13:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,13,19)\">Isa 13:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 14:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,14,11)\">Isa 14:11</ref>, Philistines <ref ref=\"Zech 9:6\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(38,9,6)\">Zech 9:6</ref>, Assyria <ref ref=\"Zech 10:11\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(38,10,11)\">Zech 10:11</ref>, Jacob <ref ref=\"Ps 47:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,47,5)\">Ps 47:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 6:8\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(30,6,8)\">Amos 6:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 8:7\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(30,8,7)\">Amos 8:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Nah 2:3\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(34,2,3)\">Nah 2:3</ref>, Israel <ref ref=\"Hos 5:5\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(28,5,5)\">Hos 5:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 7:10\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,10)\">Hos 7:10</ref> (probably appellation of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Nah 2:3\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(34,2,3)\">Nah 2:3</ref>, Judah <ref ref=\"Jer 13:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,9)\">Jer 13:9</ref>, Jerusalem v<ref ref=\"Jer 13:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,9)\">Jer 13:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:56\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"56\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"56\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,56)\">Ezek 16:56</ref> <bdbheb>גְּאוֺן עֻזָּהּ</bdbheb> <highlight>pride of her strength</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ezek 30:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,30,6)\">Ezek 30:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 30:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,30,18)\">Ezek 30:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 33:28\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(26,33,28)\">Ezek 33:28</ref> <bdbheb>גאון עזים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 7:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,7,24)\">Ezek 7:24</ref> (but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hi')\">Hi</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> read <bdbheb>עזם</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>גאון עזכם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 26:19\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,19)\">Lev 26:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 24:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,24,21)\">Ezek 24:21</ref> the fruit of land of Judah will become <bdbheb>לגאון ולתפארת</bdbheb> <highlight>majestic and beautiful</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 4:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,4,2)\">Isa 4:2</ref> <bdbheb>גאון כל צבי</bdbheb> <highlight>the majesty of all the splendour</highlight> (of Tyre) <ref ref=\"Isa 23:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,23,9)\">Isa 23:9</ref> Zion is to become <bdbheb>גאון עולם</bdbheb> <highlight>an everlasting excellency</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 60:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,15)\">Isa 60:15</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of God <ref ref=\"Exod 15:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,7)\">Exod 15:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 24:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,24,14)\">Isa 24:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 5:3\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(33,5,3)\">Mic 5:3</ref> <bdbheb>הֲדַר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>גְּאֹנוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 2:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,2,10)\">Isa 2:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 2:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,2,19)\">Isa 2:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 2:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,2,21)\">Isa 2:21</ref> <bdbheb>יַרְעֵם בְּקוֺל גְּאוֺנוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 37:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,37,4)\">Job 37:4</ref> <bdbheb>עֲדֵה נָא</bdbheb> <bdbheb>גָּאוֺן וָגֹבַהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 40:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,10)\">Job 40:10</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <bdbheb>גאון הירדן</bdbheb> <highlight>majesty of Jordan</highlight>, referring to the green and shady banks, clothed with willows, tamarisks, and cane, in which the lions made their covert <ref ref=\"Jer 49:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,19)\">Jer 49:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 50:44\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,44)\">Jer 50:44</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 11:3\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,3)\">Zech 11:3</ref>, and therefore dangerous <ref ref=\"Jer 12:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,12,5)\">Jer 12:5</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> thinks of the <highlight>swelling</highlight> of its agitated waters); <bdbheb>גְּאוֺן גַּלֶּיךָ</bdbheb> <highlight>majesty of thy waves</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 38:11\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,11)\">Job 38:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>pride</highlight> (bad sense) <ref ref=\"Job 35:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,35,12)\">Job 35:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 59:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,59,13)\">Ps 59:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 8:13\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,13)\">Prov 8:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 16:18\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,18)\">Prov 16:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 7:20\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(26,7,20)\">Ezek 7:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:49\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,49)\">Ezek 16:49</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zeph 2:10\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(36,2,10)\">Zeph 2:10</ref> of Moab <ref ref=\"Isa 16:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,16,6)\">Isa 16:6</ref> (twice in verse) = <ref ref=\"Jer 48:29\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,29)\">Jer 48:29</ref> (twice in verse). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Hos 5:5", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 5, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Job 40:10", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 40, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Lev 26:19", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 26, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Exod 15:7", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 15, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Ezek 16:56", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 16, "verse": 56}, {"raw": "Ezek 32:12", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 32, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Isa 13:11", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 13, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Isa 13:19", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 13, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Isa 14:11", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 14, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Zech 9:6", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 9, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Zech 10:11", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 10, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ps 47:5", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 47, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Amos 6:8", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 6, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Amos 8:7", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 8, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Nah 2:3", "book": "NAM", "chapter": 2, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Hos 7:10", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 7, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Jer 13:9", "book": "JER", "chapter": 13, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ezek 30:6", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 30, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Ezek 30:18", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 30, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Ezek 33:28", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 33, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Ezek 7:24", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 7, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Ezek 24:21", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 24, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Isa 4:2", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 4, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Isa 23:9